    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058550/extras/b642375b036fbb574c5a75ee4e174e07.avif?t=1752853710\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is \u00abREWOLBOROUGH\u00bb?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about a girl named Suzen, who unwillingly became involved in an illegal \u201c<strong>family</strong>\u201d business. Having revealed the disconcerting truth about her past life, the heroine has only one desire - to unravel the sinister web of conspiracy that has covered every corner of this troubled city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To date, <strong>three</strong> chapters of the planned <strong>seven</strong> are available:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Chapter I The Awakening </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Chapter II Nobody Loves You </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Chapter III The Vampiress</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chapter IV The Betrayal</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PDF version\u00a0</strong>of the digital manga are available in the root folder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay tuned for updates.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058550/extras/b642375b036fbb574c5a75ee4e174e07.avif?t=1752853710\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is \u00abREWOLBOROUGH\u00bb?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about a girl named Suzen, who unwillingly became involved in an illegal \u201c<strong>family</strong>\u201d business. Having revealed the disconcerting truth about her past life, the heroine has only one desire - to unravel the sinister web of conspiracy that has covered every corner of this troubled city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To date, <strong>three</strong> chapters of the planned <strong>seven</strong> are available:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Chapter I The Awakening </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Chapter II Nobody Loves You </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Chapter III The Vampiress</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chapter IV The Betrayal</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PDF version\u00a0</strong>of the digital manga are available in the root folder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay tuned for updates.</p>",
